      "widgets_values": [
        "[STYLE] Rough hand-drawn film storyboard frames, loose graphite pencil sketch on cream paper, sepia brown monochrome only, quick gestural linework, light cross hatching and flat sepia wash shading, unfinished pre-production concept sketch, cinematic 16:9 framing. No text, no letters, no numbers, no captions, no speech bubbles, no signature.\n[PANEL 1] Long shot, static camera. Floating island airstrip. a young woman pilot with two long braids, goggles on her head, aviator jacket and leather mail satchel walks beside a small single-engine propeller airplane. Cliffs and a distant lighthouse.\n[PANEL 2] Insert close-up of hands only. a young woman pilot with two long braids, goggles on her head, aviator jacket and leather mail satchel slides one envelope into her leather satchel next to the airplane fuselage.\n[PANEL 3] Medium tracking shot from the side. The small propeller airplane flies left to right above a sea of clouds, the pilot visible in the open cockpit.\n[PANEL 4] Over-the-shoulder shot from behind the pilot inside the cockpit: her braids and goggles in the foreground, instrument panel, a lighthouse on a cliff island ahead through the windshield.\n[PANEL 5] Medium two-shot at the lighthouse door. a young woman pilot with two long braids, goggles on her head, aviator jacket and leather mail satchel on the left hands one envelope to an old lighthouse keeper with a white beard, flat cap and long coat on the right.\n[PANEL 6] Long shot at sunset. On the left the pilot waves beside her airplane; on the right an old lighthouse keeper with a white beard, flat cap and long coat waves back from the lighthouse door.",
